[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0277","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0277.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0336","title":"银河通信 Worldgroup 3.20 远程FTP缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Galacticomm Worldgroup FTP服务器3.20及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可远程发送包含大量\"/\"、\"*\"及\"..\"字符的LIST命令，触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务崩溃（拒绝服务）并可能执行任意代码。该漏洞评估分值7.5， CVSS向量为AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P，影响范围广泛，攻击者无需身份验证即可利用此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0336"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-06-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:14Z","remediation":"升级到 Galacticomm Worldgroup 3.20 及以上版本，应用安全补丁修复 FTP 服务器缓冲区溢出漏洞。修改 FTP 服务配置，限制 LIST 命令最大长度，开启用户认证并限制访问IP。同时关闭防火墙端口21，以HTTP或SFTP代替FTP服务。若无法立即升级，建议停用FTP服务或使用强访问控制和暴力破解防护措施作为临时缓解方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101484128203523&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8297.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4185","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21305","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b3c35d89abde60a88f7cb8e626161de34dd6ab36/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0336.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bcbdb8ae7a9ef1c1e1ea2320e0a3f339a967446e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0336.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0336","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0336.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0336.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0e284be0197bae1df3d577d9f9f2155925bb6629/2002/CVE-2002-0336.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/8a3e2d14c2e04b1bff1df5344192e8356dcd6b1d/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-03xx/CVE-2002-0336.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1b97942de7f8736fb9dac77c314951b8b2cd2867/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0336.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0336.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0336.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0277.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0276","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0276.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0335","title":"Galacticomm Worldgroup Web Server 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Galacticomm Worldgroup Web Server 3.20 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送超长 HTTP GET 请求触发该漏洞，导致服务拒绝服务甚至执行任意代码。该漏洞源于 Web 服务器对 HTTP 请求长度缺乏边界检查，攻击者可构造恶意长请求溢出缓冲区，破坏程序控制流。CVSS 评分 10.0（严重级），影响系统的机密性、完整性和可用性，攻击者可完全控制受影响服务器。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0335"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-06-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:14Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 Galacticomm Worldgroup 3.20 及更早版本，迁移至现代维护中的 Web 服务器软件（如 Apache、Nginx 或 IIS），该软件厂商已停业无官方补丁。临时缓解措施：在防火墙层面限制 Web 服务端口（默认 80/443）仅允许可信 IP 访问，或在 WAF/反向代理层配置规则拦截超长 HTTP GET 请求（URL 长度 > 2048 字符），并监控异常流量。建议尽快完成业务迁移至受维护的现代平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101484128203523&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8298.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4186","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21306","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b3c35d89abde60a88f7cb8e626161de34dd6ab36/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0335.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bcbdb8ae7a9ef1c1e1ea2320e0a3f339a967446e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0335.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0335","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0335.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0335.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/23d445ba1c2af3be2483c95d0fd3ff73d6b1329c/2002/CVE-2002-0335.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/8a3e2d14c2e04b1bff1df5344192e8356dcd6b1d/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-03xx/CVE-2002-0335.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1b97942de7f8736fb9dac77c314951b8b2cd2867/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0335.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0335.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0335.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0276.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0276.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0276.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0274","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0274.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0333","title":"xtell xtelld 目录遍历信息泄露漏洞","description":"xtell xtelld 服务在处理 TTY 参数时存在目录遍历漏洞，未对 \"..\" 路径遍历序列进行有效过滤。该漏洞影响 xtell 1.91.1 及更早版本，以及 2.x 分支中 2.7 版本之前的所有版本（含 2.6.1）。远程未认证攻击者可通过网络发送包含 \"..\" 的恶意 TTY 参数，利用目录遍历读取具有短文件名的系统文件；本地用户可进一步利用短文件名符号链接扩大读取范围，获取更多敏感文件内容。攻击无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，主要造成信息泄露风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0333"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-06-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:14Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 xtell 至 2.7 或更高版本（官方已在 2.7 版本修复该目录遍历漏洞），可通过包管理器升级或从官方源编译安装最新版。若暂时无法升级，可通过防火墙限制 xtelld 服务端口（默认 4224/TCP）仅允许受信 IP 访问，或在 xinetd/inetd 配置中添加 only_from 限制访问来源 IP 段；同时检查 /etc/xtelld.conf 确保 tty 参数校验严格，禁止传入包含 \"..\" 的参数。若服务非必须，建议暂时停止 xtelld 服务并禁用开机自启。升级后请验证版本：xtelld -v 确认版本 ≥ 2.7。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101494896516467&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-121","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8313.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4194","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21310","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0333.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0333.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0333","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0333.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/23d445ba1c2af3be2483c95d0fd3ff73d6b1329c/2002/CVE-2002-0333.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0333.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1b97942de7f8736fb9dac77c314951b8b2cd2867/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0333.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-03xx/CVE-2002-0333.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0333.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0333.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0274.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0272","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0272.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0332","title":"xtelld 公司 xtell 1.91.1/2.6.1 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"xtell xtelld 守护进程存在多个远程缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过构造过长的 DNS 主机名（触发反向 DNS 查询）、过长的 AUTH 认证字符串或特制的 xtell 请求数据触发缓冲区溢出，导致远程任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 xtell 1.91.1 及更早版本，以及 2.7 版本之前的 2.x 版本。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程发送恶意数据包触发漏洞，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），成功利用可获得 xtelld 进程权限执行任意代码，影响系统机密性、完整性和可用性。建议升级至 xtell 2.7 或更高版本修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0332"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-06-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:14Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 xtell 到 2.7 或更高版本（1.x 分支无修复版本，需升级至 2.7+）。若暂时无法升级，建议在防火墙层面限制 xtell 服务端口（默认 4224/TCP）仅允许受信任 IP 访问，并禁用反向 DNS 解析功能以缓解主机名溢出风险。建议从官方源 https://www.chiark.greenend.org.uk/~ian/xtell/ 下载最新版本并重新编译安装。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101494896516467&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-121","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8312.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4193","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21309","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0332.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0332.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0332","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0332.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0332.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cf9f26fab3bbc76af663e922f8ccf4da465b1866/2002/CVE-2002-0332.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-03xx/CVE-2002-0332.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1b97942de7f8736fb9dac77c314951b8b2cd2867/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0332.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0332.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0332.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0272.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0271","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0271.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0331","title":"BPM Studio BPM Studio Pro HTTP 服务目录遍历漏洞","description":"BPM Studio Pro 4.2 内置 HTTP 服务器存在目录遍历漏洞，远程未授权攻击者可在 HTTP 请求路径中构造 `../` 目录遍历序列，绕过目录限制读取服务器文件系统上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 BPM Studio Pro 4.2 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，通过发送包含目录遍历序列的 HTTP GET 请求即可窃取服务器敏感文件（如系统配置、源代码、数据库文件等），导致敏感信息泄露，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），主要影响机密性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0331"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-06-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:13Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 BPM Studio Pro 4.3 或更高版本（若已发布修复版本），或从官方渠道下载最新版本替换旧版本。若无法升级，请立即在防火墙层面禁止外部访问 HTTP 服务端口（默认 80/8080），仅允许可信内网 IP 访问。同时在 Web 服务器配置中禁用目录遍历功能，设置 Web 根目录权限为最小权限（只读、禁止目录遍历），并部署 WAF 规则拦截包含 ../ 等目录遍历载荷的 HTTP 请求作为临时缓解措施。若业务允许，建议彻底停用该 HTTP 服务并迁移至受支持的现代媒体播放软件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101486044323352&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8300.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4198","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21311","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0331.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0331.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0331","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0331.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0331.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3846f10533f33b6add488388e63fdc90a48d6484/2002/CVE-2002-0331.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-03xx/CVE-2002-0331.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0a07da1560249b2b9027d6c5d908418017bb7740/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0331.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0331.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0331.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0271.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0269","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0269.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0330","title":"OpenBB codeparse.php 跨站脚本攻击","description":"OpenBB 论坛 1.0.0 版本（含 Beta1/RC1/RC2）的 codeparse.php 存在跨站脚本漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 IMG 标签中嵌入 JavaScript 代码，诱导受害者浏览器执行恶意脚本并窃取 Cookie。该漏洞无需身份认证、攻击复杂度低（CVSS 7.5 HIGH），攻击者仅需诱导用户访问包含恶意 IMG 标签的帖子即可触发，影响 OpenBB 1.0.x 系列版本，可导致会话劫持、账号劫持等后果。OpenBB 官方已在后续版本修复该漏洞，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0330"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-06-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:13Z","remediation":"建议升级 OpenBB 到 1.0.1 或更高版本（官方已在 1.0.1 修复此 XSS 漏洞），或升级到最新稳定版。若无法立即升级，可编辑 codeparse.php 文件，在处理 IMG 标签前添加 HTML 实体编码过滤（如使用 htmlspecialchars() 对用户输入进行转义），或在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）配置规则拦截包含 javascript: 伪协议的 IMG 标签请求，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://community.iansoft.net/read.php?TID=5159","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101466092601554&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8278.php","http://www.osvdb.org/5658","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4171","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21301","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0330.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0330.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0330","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0330.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/04172aaf351a2efb5323c8604e2705a84576d722/2002/CVE-2002-0330.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0330.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0a07da1560249b2b9027d6c5d908418017bb7740/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0330.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-03xx/CVE-2002-0330.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0330.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2002-0330.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0269.toml"],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0269.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0267","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0267.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0329","title":"Snitz Forums 2000 论坛 IMG标签 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"Snitz Forums 2000 3.3.03 及更早版本存在跨站脚本漏洞，攻击者可通过在 IMG 标签中嵌入恶意 JavaScript 代码，诱导其他论坛用户访问包含恶意图片的帖子，从而在受害者浏览器上下文中执行任意脚本代码。该漏洞影响 Snitz Forums 2000 3.0/3.1/3.3 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），属于高危漏洞。远程未认证攻击者可利用此漏洞窃取用户会话、劫持账号或执行其他恶意操作。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0329"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-06-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:13Z","remediation":"Snitz Forums 2000 已经停止维护，建议立即卸载并替换为现代社区论坛软件（如 vBulletin、XenForo 或 Discourse）。如无法立即迁移，可禁用所有用户上传图片功能并关闭图片预览脚本，以阻止利用 IMG 标签的 XSS 攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://forum.snitz.com/forum/link.asp?TOPIC_ID=23660","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101485184605149&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/258981","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8309.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/132011","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4192","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21308","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0329.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0329","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0329.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ef5f7d15f762d5df7a3a2d2246dcee2b17ebeef4/2002/CVE-2002-0329.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0329.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0329.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0a07da1560249b2b9027d6c5d908418017bb7740/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0329.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-03xx/CVE-2002-0329.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0329.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2002-0329.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0267.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0266","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0266.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0328","title":"伊科论坛 IkonBoard 跨站脚本攻击","description":"IconBoard论坛软件存在跨代理脚本攻击漏洞，该漏洞源于软件在处理图片标签时未对包含JavaScript代码的代理属性进行充分验证。攻击者可通过在帖子或回复中嵌入特制的<img>标签，注入恶意JavaScript代码，利用该漏洞实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响IconBoard 2.17、3.0和3.1等多个版本，且无需身份验证即可远程触发，可窃取其他用户的Session Cookie，导致身份盗用和权限劫持等安全问题。该漏洞涉及论坛核心功能，影响面广，评估为安全严重等级。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0328"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-06-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:13Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 IkonBoard 到 3.1.1 或更高版本（官方已修复该 XSS 漏洞）。若无法立即升级，可在管理后台禁用帖子中的 HTML/IMG 标签功能，或在论坛配置中启用 HTML 标签过滤/白名单机制，禁止 IMG 标签中的 javascript: 伪协议。同时建议在 Web 服务器层面配置 CSP 策略（Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; script-src 'self'），禁止内联脚本执行作为临时缓解措施。定期检查论坛帖子内容，清理包含恶意 IMG 标签的历史数据。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101475420818274&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4182","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21304","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0328.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0328.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0328","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0328.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0328.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f187e7be682488cc782059fd6bb7b453289ef42b/2002/CVE-2002-0328.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-03xx/CVE-2002-0328.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ef1766e2b390160881db9b8bb9c1bb8bfb197a80/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0328.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0328.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0328.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0266.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0264","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0264.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0327","title":"世纪软件 Term For Linux 6.27.869 命令行缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Century Software Term For Linux 6.27.869 的 callin 程序存在命令行缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 callin 程序传递过长的 tty 参数触发栈溢出，从而覆盖返回地址执行任意代码并获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Century Software Term For Linux 6.27.869 版本，攻击者需具备本地用户权限，通过构造超长 tty 参数调用 callin 程序即可触发溢出并提权至 root，CVSS 评分 7.2（高危），属于本地权限提升类缓冲区溢出漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0327"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-06-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:13Z","remediation":"建议立即卸载 Century Software Term 并安装最新安全补丁。如果无法立即更新，建议禁用终端程序的 setuid 权限（chmod 777 callin），并限制对终端程序的访问权限，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101477608215471&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/82/257731","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8291.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4174","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21302","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0327.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0327.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0327","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0327.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0327.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f187e7be682488cc782059fd6bb7b453289ef42b/2002/CVE-2002-0327.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-03xx/CVE-2002-0327.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ef1766e2b390160881db9b8bb9c1bb8bfb197a80/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0327.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0327.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0327.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0264.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0262","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0262.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0325","title":"Working Resources BadBlue 1.5/1.6 目录遍历漏洞","description":"BadBlue 1.5/1.6 是一个功能强大的文件共享服务器软件，但在版本 1.5 和 1.6 中存在严重的目录遍历漏洞。攻击者可通过在URL请求中嵌入特殊目录遍历符（如 '..' 等）或使用修改后的遍历符号，绕过路径验证机制，直接访问目标系统上的任意文件。攻击者无需任何身份验证即可远程触发此漏洞，利用精心构造的HTTP请求读取敏感文件，包括系统配置文件、密码文件、数据库文件等，严重威胁到系统的信息完整性和机密性。该漏洞影响 Windows 平台上安装的 BadBlue 1.5 和 1.6 版本用户，攻击者可通过网络远程利用此漏洞窃取或破坏关键系统信息。虽然攻击对系统可用性影响有限，但完整性破坏风险高。微软及厂商已发布安全补丁，建议所有用户立即升级至 BadBlue 1.6.1 或更高版本以修复此安全隐患，防止潜在的数据泄露和系统破坏风险。攻击者通过网络直接访问服务器文件系统，破坏了应用程序的访问控制机制，可能导致敏感信息泄露或系统完整性受损。攻击场景包括文件读取、密码字典获取、系统配置信息泄露等多个方面，攻击者可利用漏洞获取管理员权限、修改系统文件或植入恶意程序，对企业数据安全构成严重威胁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0325"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-06-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:13Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 BadBlue 到 1.6.1 或更高版本以修复目录遍历漏洞。若暂时无法升级，可在 Web 服务器层面配置 URL 规则拦截包含 \"../\" 或 \"..%2f\" 等目录遍历序列的请求，或在 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 添加目录遍历攻击特征规则作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101474689126219&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8295.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4179","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21303","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0325.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0325.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0325","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0325.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0325.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b057d3bcc2a1da38f6284c6c5f111734c51b6e6/2002/CVE-2002-0325.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-03xx/CVE-2002-0325.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ef1766e2b390160881db9b8bb9c1bb8bfb197a80/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0325.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0325.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0325.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0262.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0260","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0260.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0319","title":"Powie PForum 1.1x edituser.php 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Powie PForum 1.14 及更早版本的 edituser.php 存在跨站脚本攻击（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于对用户名字段输入过滤不严，远程攻击者可构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的用户名，当管理员或其他用户查看该用户信息时脚本自动执行，从而窃取目标用户的 Cookie 或会话令牌。攻击者无需认证即可发起攻击，成功利用可导致用户身份被劫持、敏感信息泄露。该漏洞危害等级高，CVSS 评分 7.5。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0319"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-06-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:12Z","remediation":"建议将 PForum 升级到最新可用版本。如厂商已停止维护，可在 edituser.php 中对 username 参数进行 HTML 实体编码输出，并过滤用户输入中的 <script>、<img> 等 HTML 标签。作为临时缓解措施，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则拦截包含 JavaScript 事件处理器（如 onerror、onclick）的 username 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101446366708757&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8263.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4165","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21299","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2002/CVE-2002-0319.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0319.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0319.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0319.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0319.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0319","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0319.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0319.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9dff795a9a7b58dca025b22ebdb342ecc8354f50/2002/CVE-2002-0319.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0319.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0260.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0260.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0260.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0258","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0258.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0316","title":"XMB Forum 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"XMB（eXtreme Message Board）论坛 1.6x 及更早版本中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过在 IMG 标签中插入恶意脚本代码，当其他用户浏览包含该恶意 IMG 标签的页面时，脚本将在其浏览器中自动执行，导致攻击者可以窃取用户会话 Cookie、发起钓鱼攻击或以受害用户身份执行任意操作。该漏洞影响 XMB Forum 1.6 pre-beta 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0316"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-06-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:12Z","remediation":"升级 XMB 论坛至 1.9.8 或更高版本（访问 https://www.xmbforum2.com/ 下载），该版本已验证不受此漏洞影响。如无法立即升级，需在论坛配置中过滤用户输入内容，对 `[img]` 标签内的 `javascript:` 等协议和 HTML 事件处理器（如 onerror、onload）做严格转义处理，禁止在 IMG 标签中插入可执行脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at"