存在命令注入漏洞。当用户对某个主机执行 DNS 反向查询时，如果该主机的 DNS 反向解析记录中包含 shell 元字符（如反引号、管道符、分号等），XChat 未对查询结果进行充分过滤和转义，直接将其传递给 shell 执行，导致远程攻击者可通过控制 DNS 解析记录，诱使受害者执行 /dns 命令，从而在受害者系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 XChat 1.4.x 及更早版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0382"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-06-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:19Z","remediation":"升级 XChat 至 1.8.8 或更高版本，该版本修复了 /dns 命令对 DNS 反向查询结果中 shell 元字符的过滤问题。Red Hat Linux 用户安装 RHSA-2002:097 或 RHSA-2002:124 更新包，Mandrake Linux 用户安装 MDKSA-2002:051 更新。临时缓解措施：避免在不可信频道中对未知主机执行 /dns 命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000526","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101725430425490&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8704.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-051.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-097.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-124.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4376","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0382.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0382.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0382","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0382.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0382.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08990b84a65d14f7de760be267bdf98ec816883a/2002/CVE-2002-0382.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/57b318ad84d91f19df2f11e62567e45db1dd90ad/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0382.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-03xx/CVE-2002-0382.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0382.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0382.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0187.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0185","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0185.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0379","title":"University of Washington uw-imapd 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"University of Washington imap server (uw-imapd) 2000.287 及更早版本，以及 2001.315 版本的 imap-2001 和 imap-2001a（启用 RFC 1730 支持时）存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞源于程序在处理部分邮箱属性时，未能对 BODY 请求的输入长度进行有效验证，导致内存溢出。经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过发送特制的超长 BODY 请求，触发缓冲区溢出并执行任意代码，从而在目标服务器上获取系统级权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0379"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-06-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:19Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 uw-imapd 至 2001.315 之后的安全版本，或迁移至 Dovecot 等现代 IMAP 服务器。若无法升级，请在配置文件中禁用对 legacy RFC 1730 协议的支持，并限制远程访问权限以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000487","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102107222100529&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4167","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9055.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/961489","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-034.php","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-2120.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-092.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4713","http://www.washington.edu/imap/buffer.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10803","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21443","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2002/CVE-2002-0379.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/231116aa5795023b4be954f9aed84939e97cf046/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0379.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0379","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0379.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2002-0379","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2002-0379","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/1f7c9527c0f5bb4cce2670b0d21c4073607d138e/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2002-0379","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/10e9467be38429ca2d719aefc6850e69115854fd/2002/CVE-2002-0379.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0379.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/63bc6ccb7d9e7d0447e23eb842c0b23beddd261c/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0379.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0185.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0179","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0179.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0354","title":"Netscape Mozilla XMLHttpRequest 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Netscape 6.1 及 Mozilla 0.9.7 浏览器中的 XMLHttpRequest 对象存在任意文件读取漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页，利用 XMLHTTP 对象发起重定向至客户端本地文件系统的 URL，再通过 responseText 属性读取返回结果，从而窃取目标系统上的任意文件内容及目录列表。该漏洞无需用户交互即可触发，攻击者仅需诱导用户访问恶意页面即可实施攻击，严重威胁用户隐私数据安全。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0354"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-06-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:16Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止支持的 Netscape 6.x 和 Mozilla 0.9.x 浏览器，厂商未发布官方补丁。建议立即停止使用上述已停止支持的浏览器版本，升级至 Mozilla Firefox（最新稳定版）或其它现代浏览器。如无法升级，可在浏览器中禁用 JavaScript 和 XMLHttpRequest 功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102017952204097&w=2","http: